--------------------------------
---
--- QR CODES AND DATAMATRIX
---
--------------------------------

Here are some Text Pattern Generator files that have been made into QR and
DataMatrix barcodes.

Examples of making QR codes using qrencode:

gcc tpl-hexgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 255 16 | qrencode -8 -o 00_qr20260505_180426.png
gcc tpl-decgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 99 10 | qrencode -8 -o 00_qr20260505_180631.png

Examples of making DataMatrix barcodes using dmtxwrite (See https://github.com/dmtx/dmtx-utils):

gcc tpl-hexgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 127 8 | dmtxwrite -e 8 -o 00_dmtx20260505_182140.png
gcc tpl-decgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 99 10 | dmtxwrite -e 8 -o 00_dmtx20260505_182309.png

Examples of making QR codes using Zint:

gcc tpl-hexgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 255 16 > 00_temp.txt
zint -b 58 --eci=26 -o 00_qr20260505_180847.png -i 00_temp.txt

gcc tpl-decgen-0001.c; ./a.out 0 99 10 > 00_temp.txt
zint -b 58 --eci=26 -o 00_qr20260505_181054.png -i 00_temp.txt

